WEBVTT

00:28:58.246 --> 00:29:02.288
I think the most important thing that
I have rethought and, you know,

00:29:02.329 --> 00:29:05.454
doesn't have any implications
for me because it's too late

00:29:05.454 --> 00:29:09.038
for me to study individual differences.
And I wouldn't like doing it anyway.

00:29:09.038 --> 00:29:15.496
It's not my style. But I think there
is much more room for it than

00:29:15.496 --> 00:29:18.413
I thought when I was writing,
thinking fast and slow.

00:29:19.788 --> 00:29:21.913
Another thing I wanted
to ask you about is

00:29:22.496 --> 00:29:25.538
the choices you make about what problems
and projects to work on.

00:29:26.788 --> 00:29:31.871
I'm not a good example for anybody.
I really never had a plan.